      <section class="references" id="sect-0015">
      <title>References</title>
      <!-- <section id="sect-011">
      <title>Identity in Context: Gender Development and Racial Identity</title>--> 
        <para id="para-00059">Anderson, L. A., O’Brien Caughy, M., &amp; Owen, M. T. (2021). “The Talk” and parenting while Black in America: Centering race, resistance, and refuge. <emphasis effect="italics">Journal of Black Psychology, 48</emphasis>(3–4), 475–506. doi.org/10.1177/00957984211034294</para>
